  {
   "settings": {
    "npcStates": [
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "name": {
          "orig": "Deggart",
          "transl": "Deggart"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "PROUD"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Hi!",
          "transl": "Привіт!"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "A \\v[lore.title.seeker]?\\. You were sent to help me with the operation, I suppose?",
          "transl": "Ein Seeker?\\. Du bist hier, um mir bei der Operation zu helfen, oder?"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[nickt]"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "I see.\\. Good, good.\\. Almost got worried. I would need a tent if assistance took any longer.",
          "transl": "Gut, gut.\\. Hatte schon befürchtet, dass ich hier übernachten muss, wenn du jetzt nicht aufgetaucht wärst."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SMILE"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Hey, I really need some sleep!\\. Spent all day surveying the area and calibrating our probe here.",
          "transl": "Hey, ich brauche wirklich etwas Schlaf!\\. Hab den ganzen Tag damit verbracht, die Gegend zu erforschen und die Sonde zu kalibrieren."
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "name": {
          "orig": "Deggart",
          "transl": "Deggart"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Yep, this work of wonder was fed the data from the Hillkat Leader's device.",
          "transl": "Genau, dieses kleine Wunderwerk hier haben wir mit den Daten aus dem Hillkat-Gerät gefüttert."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "We can use it to extract energy and data from \\c[3]Ancient Powerspots\\c[0] directly on the Track.",
          "transl": "Damit können wir die Energie und Daten eines \\c[3]Kraftpunktes der Ahnen\\c[0] direkt auf dem Pfad extrahieren."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "ASTONISHED"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...!",
          "transl": "...!"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "And this area has quite a few of those, which is ideal for a proper test run to gather data.",
          "transl": "Und diese Gegend hier hat eine Menge davon, weshalb sie für einen Testlauf ideal ist."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[nickt]"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Well, I should just explain how to operate it so we can finally get this over with and I can get back to bed.",
          "transl": "Also, ich erklär dir jetzt nur noch, wie man es bedient, damit ich endlich wieder zurück in die Pofe kann."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SMUG"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Simply put, you need to \\c[3]push this device around\\c[0] and move the \\c[3]Powerspots\\c[0] that appear in the area.",
          "transl": "Im Prinzip brauchst du \\c[3]das Gerät nur vor dir herzustoßen\\c[0] und auf die \\c[3]Kraftpunkte\\c[0] zu bewegen, die in der Nähe erscheinen."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "You can \\c[3]move\\c[0] it by \\c[3]attacking\\c[0].\\. Using \\c[3]Heat\\c[0] will greatly increase the distance and velocity.",
          "transl": "Du \\c[3]bewegst\\c[0] es, indem du es \\c[3]schlägst\\c[0].\\. Im \\c[3]Hitze-Modus\\c[0] lässt es sich deutlich weiter und schneller bewegen."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Approaching a Powerspot will usually \\c[3]attract some hostile wildlife\\c[0] that will attempt to protect it.",
          "transl": "Wenn du dich einem Kraftpunkt näherst, \\c[3]zieht das für gewöhnlich feindselige Wildtiere an\\c[0], die ihn beschützen wollen."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...!",
          "transl": "...!"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Worse, the Powerspots will grant them a \\c[3]shield\\c[0] that is almost impenetrable!\\. Invincible, angry critters!",
          "transl": "Das Schlimme daran ist, dass er ihnen einen \\c[3]Schild\\c[0] gewährt, der fast undurchdringlich ist!\\. Das Resultat: Unverwundbare und übellaunige Biester!"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SHOCKED"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...!!",
          "transl": "...!!"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Yes, exactly!\\. But luckily for you, you've got our probe here!",
          "transl": "Ja, genau!\\. Aber zum Glück hast du unsere Sonde hier!"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_AWAY"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...?",
          "transl": "...?"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "\\c[3]When placed on an active Powerspot\\c[0] it will sap away the energy and \\c[3]deactivate the shield\\c[0]!",
          "transl": "\\c[3]Wenn du sie auf einen aktivierten Kraftpunkt stößt, \\c[0]saugt sie seine Energie ab und \\c[3]deaktiviert den Schild\\c[0]!"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "ASTONISHED"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...!",
          "transl": "...!"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Just make sure it doesn't get knocked away.\\. Hitting it with \\c[3]Cold\\c[0] will \\c[3]stabilize\\c[0] it for a bit which should help.",
          "transl": "Du musst aber aufpassen, dass sie nicht weggestoßen wird.\\. Schlag sie deshalb einmal mit \\c[3]Kälte\\c[0], um sie für eine Weile zu stabilisieren."
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "name": {
          "orig": "Deggart",
          "transl": "Deggart"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "And that's it.\\. Surely an experienced \\v[lore.title.seeker] can figure it out, right?",
          "transl": "Das war's.\\. Bei deiner Erfahrung solltest du das doch locker gebacken kriegen, oder?"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[nickt]"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.male-bald-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         },
         "message": {
          "orig": "Good.\\. Talk to me again when you're ready and prepared.",
          "transl": "Gut.\\. Sag Bescheid, wenn du so weit bist."
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
